    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:b04d5d61d358e759",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "ad536167f4a60a93a391d46d4f2b73be76fab70184397a9cc8d382873b769058",
      "text": "After breakfast, set out with your guide to explore the historic treasures of Minas Gerais. Visit the historic town of Mariana and the Mina da Passagem, a former gold mine that offers a fascinating glimpse into the region’s mining heritage.\n\nContinue to Ouro Preto, one of Brazil’s most remarkable colonial towns and the jewel of Minas Gerais, a UNESCO World Heritage Site. Once a major centre of gold mining and the stage of an important chapter in Brazil’s independence movement, it is renowned for its beautifully preserved colonial architecture, Baroque churches and artistic heritage. A guided walk through its historic streets reveals the remarkable legacy of one of Brazil’s most fascinating destinations.\n\nIncluded: Mariana and Mina da Passagem · Ouro Preto city tour (private, with guide) · Breakfast",
